ATOBench Cross-Model Runner (Open-Source Edition)
Copyright 2026 ATOBench contributors

This directory is a release projection of the executable ATOBench cross-model
runtime. It retains the runner, CLI, agent carrier, proxy/rule engine, schemas,
scaffold compiler, Protocol-v3 configuration, and the public Juice Shop
confirmatory suite. It intentionally excludes local configuration, credentials,
run outputs, frozen experiment logs, reviewer submissions, and private lineage.
